# ── Rubberr relay secrets (S6) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# register_token -> user_id map (relay/config.py's REGISTER_TOKENS_FILE
# default) — following docs/PLATFORM_RUNBOOK.md must never commit this.
# NOTE: relay/register_tokens.example.json is intentionally NOT matched here —
# it ships as a checked-in template with no real tokens in it.
relay/register_tokens.json
relay/*secret*
